Package: tenfold-tweaks
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Tenfold Tweaks <tenfold-tweaks@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, pkexec | policykit-1, dpkg (>= 1.19.2)
Recommends: gir1.2-adw-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: change desktop, lock screen and login screen backgrounds
 Sets the desktop, lock screen and login screen (GDM, Kali GDM, LightDM)
 backgrounds from the command line or a GTK 4 dashboard, with restore to
 the stock images. Admin rights are asked only for the login screen.
